                           fm1_0RB1LD_1LC1RB_1RA1LA_1RA0LC fm2_0RB1LD_1LC1RB_1RA1LA_1RA0LC 0 vis_0RB1LD_1LC1RB_1RA1LA_1RA0LC
                           [0] 0 50).
  - vm_compute; lia.
  - vm_compute; reflexivity.
  - vm_compute; reflexivity.
  - intros ph Hph.
    destruct ph as [|ph].
    { vm_compute; repeat constructor. }
    destruct ph as [|ph].
    { vm_compute; repeat constructor. }
    exfalso; lia.
  - intros ph Hph.
    destruct ph as [|ph].
    { vm_compute; repeat constructor. }
    destruct ph as [|ph].
    { vm_compute; repeat constructor. }
    exfalso; lia.
  - intros ph Hph.
