  - exact farm_sound_0RB1LD_1LC1RB_1RA1LA_1RA0LC.
  - exact farm_lhs_0RB1LD_1LC1RB_1RA1LA_1RA0LC.
  - exact farm_rhs_0RB1LD_1LC1RB_1RA1LA_1RA0LC.
  - exact farm_cb_0RB1LD_1LC1RB_1RA1LA_1RA0LC.
  - exact vis_ok_0RB1LD_1LC1RB_1RA1LA_1RA0LC.
Qed.

